sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Gallus gallus Holocene Turing pigment-ocellus wavelength, 319.2 µm (pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 86.4/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 keeps λ_c = 319.2 µm at 0 Ma on the singleton Gallus chronoseries. Inhibitor diffusivity is swept at fixed γ: the Turing margin crosses 1 and λ_c falls as Dv rises. A 1800-step Schnakenberg integration grows the critical mode at Dv = 16 (std 0.021 to 0.026) and decays it under equal diffusion (std 0.0025). The gallery plate's contiguous scale bar is 110 px, so the painted pitch is 66.4 µm, which is not 319.2 µm. A three-harmonic radial model trained on even radii has held-out Pearson r = 0.9855 against a detuned-wavenumber null of lower correlation, with held-out RMSE 5.50 and KS 0.084. Structure-tensor coherency of the rendered frame (0.958) is compared with the plate (0.846). The 12-frame 800×600 GIF scores CV similarity 90.5 against that plate. Overall 86.4/100 (faithfulness 85.7, reproducibility 87.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit d996d1f6820869dd1e2694a6d36819f4719a6704; environment: python 3.12.3, note numpy, scipy, pillow, matplotlib, pyyaml, rdflib. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 83, Parameter expressivity 86, Morphometric validation 87, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 85, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/gallus_gallus_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0.py at d996d1f6820869dd1e2694a6d36819f4719a6704, image/png, 406896 B, 1536×888 px, artifact_sha256 eebe3c4bcde6058f8858e7bc711685cf5cf1f1ab20ab979634e229480bbc2848 (sha256 eebe3c4bcde6058f8858e7bc711685cf5cf1f1ab20ab979634e229480bbc2848), spec_fingerprint d79e485299e3508a55f35819cf41b353933badb10f650ee2ade00ae23887b314. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: d79e485299e3508a55f35819cf41b353933badb10f650ee2ade00ae23887b314; artifact_sha256: eebe3c4bcde6058f8858e7bc711685cf5cf1f1ab20ab979634e229480bbc2848; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/gallus_gallus_turing_wavelength_s0/gallus_gallus_ocellus_specimen.jpg=7e7d58db6bb564eb..., datasets/gallus_gallus_turing_wavelength_s0/gallus_gallus_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=5589d95bf0b106f7...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing (1952) derived a finite-wavenumber instability of a homogeneous reaction-diffusion state. | Prum & Williamson (2002) reproduced within-feather bars, spots, and ocelli with reaction-diffusion on a growing feather germ. | Harris et al. (2005) reported Shh/Bmp2 activator-inhibitor interactions during barb-ridge formation in embryonic Gallus gallus.; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg onset at (a, b, Du, Dv) = (0.2005, 0.7995, 1, 16) with γ solved so λ_c = 319.2 µm. | Dv sweep, equal-diffusion ablation, and a short periodic integration of the same kinetics. | Held-out three-harmonic radial fit and computer-vision segmentation of the gallery ocellus plate. | Singleton Holocene chronoseries: age 0 Ma, no predecessor and no successor.; transfer_boundary: 319.2 µm is the slot wavelength. The painted bar measures a 66.4 µm ring pitch on this plate and is not used as λ_c. | The radial reconstruction is a weakly nonlinear reduction of the critical circle, not Prum & Williamson's full growing-feather geometry.; does_not_claim: A blinded test on a second feather. | That the painted 100 µm bar equals 319.2 µm. | An independent second assessor.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R6', 'item': 'Still one gallery plate. A second calibrated micrograph of a Gallus feather ocellus would separate the fit from the picture it was fit to.'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R7', 'item': 'Still a single assessor. An independent second provider was not available in this run.'}" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.864"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, single agent; pass-2 rescore after remediation)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://x.ai> .
}

